<HTML><HEAD><TITLE>Pizza Order Form</TITLE></HEAD>
<BODY BGCOLOR=#FFFFFF>
<FORM METHOD="POST" ACTION="/~wsdocs/javasdk/Pizza.servlet">
<IMG SRC="/~wsdocs/images/JavaCup-anim.gif" width=57 height=88 align=absmiddle>
<B>Godzilla's Pizza -- Internet Delivery Service</B><P>
At present, we accept internet orders only for medium (13")
size pizzas. It is now 17:16
. You will have your pizza by 
18:16.
<PRE>          Name: <INPUT SIZE=30 NAME="name">
Street address: <INPUT SIZE=30 NAME="address">
  Phone number: <INPUT SIZE=15 NAME="phone">
          City: <SELECT NAME="city">
                <OPTION SELECTED>Mesa (free)
                <OPTION>Chandler (free)
                <OPTION>Scottsdale ($15.00)
                <OPTION>Buckeye ($5.00)
                <OPTION>Tempe ($2.50)
                </SELECT> 
</PRE>
Which toppings would you like? <BR>
<OL>
<LI> <INPUT TYPE="checkbox" NAME="topping" VALUE="pepperoni">
     Pepperoni.
<LI> <INPUT TYPE="checkbox" NAME="topping" VALUE="sausage">
     Sausage.
<LI> <INPUT TYPE="checkbox" NAME="topping" VALUE="anchovies">
     Anchovies.
</OL>
To order your pizza and free Java, press this button: <INPUT TYPE="submit"
VALUE="Order Pizza">
</FORM>
<HR>
Click below to send mail to our order desk:<BR>
<A HREF="mailto:Orders@Godzilla.com">
<ADDRESS>&lt;Orders@Godzilla.com&gt;</ADDRESS>
</BODY></HTML>
